* eeg_testmux check
.include /work/Test-2-4/functional/models/design.ngspice
.lib /work/Test-2-4/functional/models/sm141064.ngspice ff
.include /work/Test-2-4/functional/sim_work/gf180/tapeout/test/eeg_testmux.spice
.temp -20
VDD AVDD 0 3.3
VVCM VCM 0 1.65
VVREFP VREFP 0 1.9
VVREFN VREFN 0 1.4
VVBN VBN 0 0.85
VVBCM VBCM 0 0.82
VVBN1 VBN1 0 0.851
VVNC1 VNC1 0 2.0
VVPC1 VPC1 0 1.7
VVBPC2 VBPC2 0 1.8
VVBNC2 VBNC2 0 1.5
VAOP AOP 0 1.61
VAON AON 0 1.69
VO2P O2P 0 1.63
VO2N O2N 0 1.67
IITST AVDD ITST 31.4u
* the mirror cannot pull above about 3 V; keeps ITST defined if both TGs were off
DITST ITST AVDD dclamp
.model dclamp d is=1e-15
VTC0 TC0 0 0.0
VTC1 TC1 0 3.3
VTC2 TC2 0 3.3
VTC3 TC3 0 0.0
VTC4 TC4 0 3.3
RATP ATP 0 1Meg
XM ATP TC0 TC1 TC2 TC3 TC4 VCM VREFP VREFN VBN VBCM VBN1 VNC1 VPC1 VBPC2 VBNC2 ITST AOP AON O2P O2N AVDD 0 eeg_testmux
.control
set noaskquit
op
print v(atp) i(vvcm) i(vvrefp) i(vvrefn) i(vvbn) i(vvbcm) i(vvbn1) i(vvnc1) i(vvpc1) i(vvbpc2) i(vvbnc2) i(vaop) i(vaon) i(vo2p) i(vo2n) 
quit
.endc
.end
